  "reason": "Existing evidence shows scvi_n200 (config_004) outperforms pca_n2000 (config_001) for RNA-only singleprofile. This experiment tests whether multiprofile (profile_setting=multiprofile) with scvi_n200 (the better RNA encoder) improves validation accuracy. It isolates the effect of profile setting while maintaining the current best RNA encoder, addressing uncertainty about whether multiprofile benefits performance. This balances exploitation of scvi_n200 and exploration of profile settings."  
